WEBVTT

00:00:31.710 --> 00:00:32.880
No way...

00:00:32.880 --> 00:00:37.300
I didn't expect to witness such a spectacular match in England, the land where soccer originated from.

00:00:37.300 --> 00:00:38.180
Yeah.

00:01:48.790 --> 00:01:55.300
Charge!

00:03:45.030 --> 00:03:46.740
Stop joking around!

00:03:47.790 --> 00:03:50.290
Releasing players yet again?

00:03:50.290 --> 00:03:52.500
Has the manager been decided already?

00:03:52.500 --> 00:03:55.040
If you recruit a useless one again, I will kill you all!

00:03:55.040 --> 00:03:58.170
Right now, we are discussing this matter...

00:03:58.170 --> 00:04:01.670
...so for now, please head back.

00:04:01.670 --> 00:04:04.180
Who on earth will go back empty-handed like this, idiot?!

00:04:05.260 --> 00:04:06.430
Over here!

00:04:06.430 --> 00:04:07.760
Alright, pass the ball!

00:04:08.560 --> 00:04:09.680
Kota, it's our chance now!

00:04:09.680 --> 00:04:10.560
Shoot!

00:04:13.810 --> 00:04:15.900
You missed again.

00:04:15.900 --> 00:04:17.440
Just where the heck are you aiming at?

00:04:20.740 --> 00:04:23.530
N-no, I missed it on purpose as I was aiming the suspicious person over there!

00:04:23.530 --> 00:04:24.530
That suspicious person!

00:04:26.240 --> 00:04:29.620
Hey, unauthorized people are not allowed to come in here!

00:04:32.250 --> 00:04:33.000
Me?

00:04:34.170 --> 00:04:35.880
Who else except you then?!

00:04:35.880 --> 00:04:37.380
You are the most suspicious around here!

00:04:38.710 --> 00:04:39.590
What are you saying?

00:04:43.720 --> 00:04:46.220
Are you a student of the ETU soccer academy?

00:04:46.890 --> 00:04:47.970
That's right.

00:04:50.520 --> 00:04:53.350
Just nice...tell me about something about it then!

00:04:59.270 --> 00:05:00.820
ETU is weak!

00:05:01.070 --> 00:05:02.320
Very weak!

00:05:02.530 --> 00:05:04.780
The manager is constantly changing...

00:05:04.860 --> 00:05:07.370
...and yet they are still very weak!

00:05:07.570 --> 00:05:11.040
We could probably even outperform them!

00:05:11.540 --> 00:05:15.210
Well then, what is ETU's weakness?

00:05:15.250 --> 00:05:16.750
They just can't score a goal...

00:05:16.750 --> 00:05:17.790
Their defense is weak!

00:05:17.790 --> 00:05:18.710
They cannot win any competition!

00:05:19.500 --> 00:05:20.500
Wait a minute...

00:05:21.460 --> 00:05:22.510
Who the hell are you, sir?

00:05:22.630 --> 00:05:24.470
Could it be that you are a spy?

00:05:25.840 --> 00:05:27.890
There is nothing worth spying for such a weak team.

00:05:28.590 --> 00:05:30.010
Well, that's true...

00:05:32.390 --> 00:05:35.980
I am here...to help make ETU strong.

00:05:37.480 --> 00:05:39.360
Are you all underestimating us just because we are fans?

00:05:39.810 --> 00:05:40.570
President!

00:05:40.570 --> 00:05:41.650
Get out now!

00:05:44.240 --> 00:05:45.280
I am going out!

00:05:46.110 --> 00:05:47.700
No, Gotou.

00:05:48.200 --> 00:05:49.530
Let's continue our meeting.

00:05:52.540 --> 00:05:52.950
Yes.

00:05:55.290 --> 00:05:58.620
I didn't expect that the standard of our fans have deteriorated within 10 years.

00:05:58.880 --> 00:05:59.920
Shut up.

00:06:00.750 --> 00:06:02.550
The responsibility is on us.

00:06:02.710 --> 00:06:07.680
But President, the average attendance has dropped to eight thousand already.

00:06:08.130 --> 00:06:11.600
Furthermore, there're rumours that the municipality are withdrawing their support for our home ground.

00:06:11.720 --> 00:06:13.510
W-What are you saying?!

00:06:13.930 --> 00:06:15.680
We don't have a parent company as support!

00:06:16.560 --> 00:06:18.350
Without the help of the municipality, we would not be able to continue our operations!

00:06:19.310 --> 00:06:20.810
Found a sponsor yet?!

00:06:21.520 --> 00:06:22.820
No... not yet.

00:06:23.690 --> 00:06:25.070
Just what on earth are you doing?!

00:06:25.320 --> 00:06:28.740
In times like this, you need to calm down more, Vice-President!

00:06:29.280 --> 00:06:30.450
Nonsense!

00:06:30.530 --> 00:06:31.070
What?!

00:06:31.620 --> 00:06:33.280
This is a life-and-death matter!

00:06:33.870 --> 00:06:37.410
It is your responsibility, President! Resign now, you stupid big brother!

00:06:38.290 --> 00:06:40.170
You have been acting like this since young...

00:06:40.290 --> 00:06:41.210
Shut up!

00:06:44.880 --> 00:06:45.920
Here, some tea.

00:06:46.550 --> 00:06:48.800
Now it's not the time for arguments, uncle.

00:06:49.340 --> 00:06:51.340
Dad, you should stop it too!

00:06:52.140 --> 00:06:53.510
The problems are still piling up like a mountain.

00:06:54.260 --> 00:06:57.140
But there is only one solution to break free of this situation.

00:06:58.020 --> 00:06:59.100
Gotou...

00:06:59.890 --> 00:07:02.560
And that solution is for ETU to win.

00:07:03.730 --> 00:07:05.400
Because of this, I'm bringing him back.

00:07:05.980 --> 00:07:07.900
No, I pleaded with him to come back.

00:07:13.120 --> 00:07:15.660
Yup, I am here to handle this matter.

00:07:21.830 --> 00:07:23.880
Ta-Tatsumi?!

00:07:26.130 --> 00:07:27.090
Long time no see!

00:07:27.380 --> 00:07:29.010
How long have you been standing there?

00:07:31.180 --> 00:07:32.430
For a while.

00:07:35.470 --> 00:07:36.970
The old times never change.

00:07:37.140 --> 00:07:37.970
Hey!

00:07:38.390 --> 00:07:40.350
How thick-skinned of you to come back here!

00:07:40.890 --> 00:07:44.520
I have not forgiven you for betraying the team yet!

00:07:44.610 --> 00:07:46.520
You're the same old, aren't you?

00:07:46.860 --> 00:07:48.440
Even your wig's still the same.

00:07:54.870 --> 00:07:56.200
I'm back, father.

00:07:57.870 --> 00:08:01.330
Tatsumi, you haven't change much either.

00:08:04.460 --> 00:08:07.460
Well, it's not like I have nothing to do,

00:08:08.250 --> 00:08:10.050
I am actually quite busy.

00:08:11.090 --> 00:08:12.300
Like moving houses.

00:08:16.640 --> 00:08:18.680
Tatsumi, you idiot.

00:08:19.470 --> 00:08:22.890
I have never heard of any manager who stays inside the club house.

00:08:23.600 --> 00:08:27.110
I don't want a futon...change it to a bed for me.

00:08:28.690 --> 00:08:30.940
And help me order dinner too.

00:08:31.240 --> 00:08:33.820
I want fried rice and some dumplings for tonight.

00:08:35.070 --> 00:08:36.910
W-who the hell do you think you are?

00:08:37.410 --> 00:08:39.910
The king. The manager's the king.

00:08:41.620 --> 00:08:44.210
I think he will definitely fail.

00:08:44.830 --> 00:08:46.380
The fans won't agree with this.

00:08:47.080 --> 00:08:49.920
They are different compared to the time when Tatsumi was still in the team.

00:08:51.800 --> 00:08:52.970
I beg to differ.

00:08:54.880 --> 00:08:57.430
Only after you watch how he acts as a manager...

00:08:58.260 --> 00:08:59.220
But then...

00:08:59.640 --> 00:09:05.270
He will surely create a wave of ETU storm in this city.

00:09:06.480 --> 00:09:09.320
And, he'll transform this city just like he did in the other one.

00:09:10.270 --> 00:09:11.230
What city?

00:09:11.610 --> 00:09:13.570
Is it that village in England?

00:09:15.400 --> 00:09:16.570
I saw it...

00:09:17.740 --> 00:09:21.490
The charm of soccer; people crying in sorrow, laughing happily...

00:09:22.040 --> 00:09:23.370
...and the shadow of those who cheer their hearts out!

00:09:27.170 --> 00:09:31.170
London, Liverpool, Birmingham

00:09:33.050 --> 00:09:35.630
Just where on earth is that guy?

00:09:37.930 --> 00:09:39.350
I am managing in England!
-Tatsumi

00:09:39.350 --> 00:09:41.260
Maybe he's given up.

00:09:41.260 --> 00:09:41.560
I am managing in England!
-Tatsumi

00:09:42.350 --> 00:09:45.390
No...Tatsumi will never abandon soccer.

00:09:45.980 --> 00:09:49.400
He must be around somewhere that is filled with scene of soccer.

00:10:00.030 --> 00:10:02.950
T-They are coming this way!

00:10:22.640 --> 00:10:27.060
An England amateur club went into the Top 32 of FA Cup?

00:10:37.440 --> 00:10:39.030
A-Amazing...

00:10:49.670 --> 00:10:50.670
That's...

00:11:04.560 --> 00:11:07.220
Open up a path for me!

00:11:07.560 --> 00:11:09.980
The king has come back victorious!

00:11:17.610 --> 00:11:20.490
In the end, he still lost to a Premiership team, right?

00:11:20.780 --> 00:11:23.870
But at one point, they fought back to lead 3-2!

00:11:31.790 --> 00:11:34.380
Do you understand what it means?

00:11:34.790 --> 00:11:35.790
Oh, very "amazing"?

00:11:37.380 --> 00:11:38.630
Don't go overboard!

00:11:39.130 --> 00:11:42.260
We've already placed all of our bets on Tatsumi.

00:11:47.100 --> 00:11:48.060
I'm back!

00:11:48.560 --> 00:11:50.390
You're late, Kota.

00:11:51.020 --> 00:11:55.690
Dad, listen to me! Today, I saw the new manager of the main team!

00:11:56.230 --> 00:12:00.650
Is that so? Anyway, he will probably quit soon, right?

00:12:01.740 --> 00:12:05.280
What are you saying? Aren't you still a fan of ETU?

00:12:05.740 --> 00:12:08.870
Mum mentioned that you used to quite the passionate fan.

00:12:09.580 --> 00:12:13.330
Even till now, I am still a fan, though not as passionate as I used to be.

00:12:13.710 --> 00:12:15.420
You don't even go to stadium to watch the match!

00:12:16.000 --> 00:12:17.670
Adults are very busy, you know.

00:12:18.460 --> 00:12:22.970
But still, I think I saw the manager somewhere before...

00:12:23.800 --> 00:12:24.840
Where exactly...

00:12:27.430 --> 00:12:28.640
Dad!

00:12:30.720 --> 00:12:33.850
It's him! He's the new manager!

00:12:39.570 --> 00:12:42.490
I see...no wonder I find him to be nostalgic.

00:12:45.450 --> 00:12:46.700
Is that so, Kota?

00:12:48.160 --> 00:12:49.540
Is he really the...

00:12:49.740 --> 00:12:51.660
No mistake about it, it's him alright!

00:12:57.380 --> 00:12:59.840
Hey, Shige!

00:13:01.300 --> 00:13:03.920
Did you hear? ETU has a new manager!

00:13:06.760 --> 00:13:07.430
What is it?

00:13:07.970 --> 00:13:09.260
What happened, Goro?

00:13:09.720 --> 00:13:10.600
To me, soccer is al-

00:13:10.600 --> 00:13:11.770
It's Tatsumi!

00:13:12.980 --> 00:13:16.520
Tatsumi has become the manager, and he's back in our town!

00:13:20.270 --> 00:13:22.690
Isn't that big news?

00:13:22.780 --> 00:13:24.450
Amazing, isn't it?!

00:13:24.700 --> 00:13:26.450
Do Yuuji and the rest know about this yet?

00:13:26.860 --> 00:13:27.320
Nope.

00:13:27.780 --> 00:13:29.330
Let's go inform them, then!

00:13:29.450 --> 00:13:30.030
Yes!

00:13:33.750 --> 00:13:34.620
Tatsumi!

00:13:37.000 --> 00:13:38.960
That Tatsumi is back...

00:13:42.130 --> 00:13:43.630
But Goro...

00:13:44.590 --> 00:13:45.760
Can Tatsumi...

00:13:46.300 --> 00:13:47.760
...really take up the managerial position?

00:13:51.220 --> 00:13:53.390
Who knows...

00:14:10.490 --> 00:14:11.780
So this is it...

00:14:12.450 --> 00:14:15.950
What those kids were saying aren't lies afterall.

00:14:20.040 --> 00:14:21.090
Next up...

00:14:31.300 --> 00:14:33.060
I will not demand that you all approve of this immediately...

00:14:33.890 --> 00:14:36.430
But at least look at our current situation.

00:14:37.350 --> 00:14:39.730
Gotou, you really don't understand anything, do you?

00:14:40.900 --> 00:14:44.070
We too are unable to give in so easily.

00:14:45.570 --> 00:14:46.650
All of us...

00:14:47.690 --> 00:14:49.700
...will never forgive Tatsumi.

00:14:52.870 --> 00:14:55.240
Anyway, can you all please remove these banners?

00:14:55.950 --> 00:14:56.660
I refuse!

00:14:57.370 --> 00:14:59.830
Tatsumi has no right to lead ETU!

00:15:00.210 --> 00:15:02.290
Or have you forgotten what he did before?

00:15:02.290 --> 00:15:04.750
That's right!

00:15:05.590 --> 00:15:08.630
The soccer team was built around Tatsumi.

00:15:08.880 --> 00:15:12.590
But in the end, a foreigner came to buy him off and he just ruthlessly abandoned ETU!

00:15:13.010 --> 00:15:17.310
After Tatsumi went, the team started to waver and was also demoted to League Two.

00:15:18.060 --> 00:15:20.600
No, it's not Tatsumi's fault alone.

00:15:20.810 --> 00:15:25.730
As a prominent member of the team, he abandoned the heavy responsibility of leading us.

00:15:26.480 --> 00:15:29.650
We do not believe in Tatsumi and the management.

00:15:30.360 --> 00:15:32.240
What we believe in...

00:15:32.740 --> 00:15:33.780
It's Murakoshi!

00:15:34.280 --> 00:15:35.660
Murakoshi!

00:15:36.540 --> 00:15:38.870
ETU will be entrusted to you again this year!

00:15:41.080 --> 00:15:42.330
We'll leave it to you!

00:15:43.420 --> 00:15:47.000
That's right, we only believe in one person...

00:15:47.840 --> 00:15:51.010
Mr ETU, Murakoshi.

00:15:52.430 --> 00:15:55.850
It's thanks to him holding the team together that the current ETU exists.

00:15:57.220 --> 00:15:58.930
At this stage, Tatsumi does not matter anymore.

00:16:01.980 --> 00:16:03.100
Tatsumi

00:16:03.100 --> 00:16:05.270
Today's the first day of practice, isn't it?

00:16:05.400 --> 00:16:07.730
Everyone has started warming up!

00:16:08.070 --> 00:16:10.990
Damn...I was burning midnight oil yesterday.

00:16:11.320 --> 00:16:13.910
Yuri, quickly prepare breakfast for me!

00:16:15.200 --> 00:16:17.740
If I don't take breakfast, my brain will not be able to function normally.

00:16:18.240 --> 00:16:19.750
I would like a fried egg sandwich...

00:16:21.040 --> 00:16:24.460
What time is it already...you really are...

00:16:24.880 --> 00:16:25.750
One more thing.

00:16:27.040 --> 00:16:28.630
Here, ask everyone to follow the instruction on this.

00:16:30.510 --> 00:16:33.930
It's fine...I have already decided the activity for today.

00:16:34.890 --> 00:16:39.680
Before the manager is here, we'll do a thirty-meter run.

00:16:40.640 --> 00:16:42.020
And your timing will be recorded!

00:16:42.390 --> 00:16:43.890
Treat this exercise seriously!

00:16:44.190 --> 00:16:45.650
Yes!

00:16:48.150 --> 00:16:50.980
What is this? And I was waiting so eagerly too...

00:16:51.240 --> 00:16:54.360
Me too. I'm so nervous that I have no energy left!

00:16:54.780 --> 00:16:56.450
How about you, Tsubaki?

00:16:59.030 --> 00:17:01.330
I don't really know about the manager.

00:17:03.290 --> 00:17:05.330
How can you not know, Tsubaki?

00:17:05.580 --> 00:17:07.380
He once represented Japan in national colors!

00:17:08.170 --> 00:17:09.920
He was also the playmaker!

00:17:13.090 --> 00:17:15.010
But isn't he being disliked?

00:17:15.760 --> 00:17:18.350
Well, our fans are easily agitated afterall...

00:17:22.470 --> 00:17:25.640
Murakoshi, you used to play with Tatsumi, right?

00:17:26.270 --> 00:17:27.810
Only for one season.

00:17:28.400 --> 00:17:30.070
The year when I was still a rookie.

00:17:30.610 --> 00:17:33.820
Then it's been a long time...are you looking forward to seeing him?

00:17:36.820 --> 00:17:39.740
Not really...I'm fine with anything.

00:17:40.080 --> 00:17:43.290
I only care about how he will fare as the manager.

00:17:43.910 --> 00:17:47.960
Furthermore, no matter who the manager is, we're still players.

00:17:48.750 --> 00:17:53.130
If we want to advance further this year, then we...

00:17:59.010 --> 00:18:02.760
...should stop idle chatter and just do our best.

00:18:04.220 --> 00:18:04.770
Yes!

00:18:06.230 --> 00:18:10.060
As expected of Murakoshi. He's able to get everyone in the right mindset.

00:18:10.860 --> 00:18:15.280
If Murakoshi weren't here, ETU would probably cease to exist today.

00:18:15.610 --> 00:18:18.660
After Tatsumi left, we were quickly relegated to League Two.

00:18:19.280 --> 00:18:21.700
Many of our players left the team.

00:18:22.740 --> 00:18:26.000
Even so, ETU managed to bounce back to League One quickly.

00:18:27.000 --> 00:18:30.500
Without a doubt, it's Murakoshi who brought the team up.

00:18:31.170 --> 00:18:34.170
Mr ETU...and Tatsumi...

00:18:36.630 --> 00:18:38.550
Alright, let's begin!

00:18:38.930 --> 00:18:41.300
It would be great if we can see them work together positively.

00:18:42.390 --> 00:18:53.940
Set...go!

00:18:55.980 --> 00:18:58.110
Data on a 30-metre run...

00:18:58.570 --> 00:19:00.450
Why are we doing this test now?

00:19:04.030 --> 00:19:05.040
Tsubaki...

00:19:05.450 --> 00:19:07.750
A player with farm clubs till last year...

00:19:08.620 --> 00:19:09.830
Let's go, Tsubaki!

00:19:10.290 --> 00:19:10.960
Yes!

00:19:12.130 --> 00:19:13.000
I'm counting on you!

00:19:15.500 --> 00:19:16.840
Set...go!

00:19:24.010 --> 00:19:25.600
What's up with this guy?

00:19:34.940 --> 00:19:36.860
He's pretty fast.

00:19:39.400 --> 00:19:41.610
Coach, everyone's done with the test.

00:19:43.740 --> 00:19:45.450
Then, we shall do a retest.

00:19:45.700 --> 00:19:47.080
How many times do we have to run?

00:19:47.410 --> 00:19:49.120
Until I say it's okay.

00:19:50.710 --> 00:19:52.080
There's no choice!

00:19:52.330 --> 00:19:54.250
Afterall, this is the manager's instructions!

00:19:57.550 --> 00:19:59.510
Set...go!

00:20:01.680 --> 00:20:03.180
Go!

00:20:08.720 --> 00:20:12.190
Put some spirit into it, guys! We're recording the timings seriously!

00:20:19.480 --> 00:20:20.860
Do we still need to run?

00:20:21.570 --> 00:20:23.320
Just how long do we need to keep running?

00:20:25.740 --> 00:20:27.200
Why are we doing this?

00:20:35.080 --> 00:20:37.670
Look, it's him!

00:20:39.710 --> 00:20:42.050
Okay, one last time!

00:20:42.050 --> 00:20:44.430
Yes!

00:20:54.850 --> 00:20:57.110
I am Tatsumi Takeshi. Thiry five years old.

00:20:58.020 --> 00:20:59.480
From now on, I will be your manager.

00:21:00.610 --> 00:21:01.940
Let's take good care of each other.

00:21:02.650 --> 00:21:03.280
So then...

00:21:04.200 --> 00:21:06.700
I'm counting on you, manager.

00:21:08.070 --> 00:21:09.990
No need for the formalities, coach.

00:21:11.120 --> 00:21:13.620
He called the coach Macchan?

00:21:14.580 --> 00:21:16.420
Tatsumi!

00:21:16.420 --> 00:21:17.290
Get out of here!

00:21:17.290 --> 00:21:19.130
Stop joking around!

00:21:20.880 --> 00:21:22.010
Excuse me, Tatsumi.

00:21:22.630 --> 00:21:23.720
I will go ahead and calm them down.

00:21:23.920 --> 00:21:27.840
It's fine...it will be far more merrier with an audience around.

00:21:28.510 --> 00:21:29.100
Matsuhara...

00:21:29.510 --> 00:21:31.260
Where are the timings for the thirty-meter run?

00:21:31.810 --> 00:21:33.350
Here it is.

00:21:38.060 --> 00:21:40.980
Whoever gets called out, please gather here.

00:21:41.940 --> 00:21:42.940
Akasaki.

00:21:42.940 --> 00:21:43.650
Yes.

00:21:43.650 --> 00:21:44.360
Sera.

00:21:44.360 --> 00:21:44.860
Yes.

00:21:45.240 --> 00:21:46.070
Miyano.

00:21:46.070 --> 00:21:46.490
Yes.

00:21:46.780 --> 00:21:47.700
Hiroi.

00:21:47.700 --> 00:21:48.030
Yes.

00:21:48.030 --> 00:21:49.160
Kiyogawa.

00:21:49.160 --> 00:21:49.620
Yes.

00:21:49.780 --> 00:21:50.910
Ishihama.

00:21:50.910 --> 00:21:51.330
Yes.

00:21:51.620 --> 00:21:52.200
Kanoi.

00:21:52.330 --> 00:21:52.790
Yes.

00:21:52.870 --> 00:21:53.750
Kobayashi.

00:21:53.750 --> 00:21:54.200
Yes.

00:21:54.500 --> 00:21:55.160
Yano.

00:21:55.160 --> 00:21:55.580
Yes.

00:21:56.960 --> 00:21:57.620
Tsubaki.

00:21:58.630 --> 00:21:59.170
Yes.

00:22:03.130 --> 00:22:04.130
The young players are all here.

00:22:04.760 --> 00:22:06.680
Guess we're the substitutes, eh.

00:22:08.430 --> 00:22:09.680
Congratulations!

00:22:10.850 --> 00:22:13.390
You guys will be the regular team members!

00:22:16.890 --> 00:22:19.980
We're...regulars?

00:22:19.980 --> 00:22:22.940
Wait a minute manager...you're joking, right?

00:22:23.440 --> 00:22:26.150
They haven't handled the ball and you've already decided based on the results of the run?

00:22:26.570 --> 00:22:28.990
Furthermore, why did you left Murakoshi out?!

00:22:31.120 --> 00:22:34.450
I figured that you all won't be able to accept it, so for now I'll have you to accept it.

00:22:34.830 --> 00:22:36.290
Fifteen minutes from now...

00:22:37.660 --> 00:22:39.290
I'll take command of this group.

00:22:40.170 --> 00:22:41.210
Coach, you'll command the other group.

00:22:42.670 --> 00:22:45.260
If you guys win, I'll reconsider my decision.

00:22:50.140 --> 00:22:52.470
In this way, no one should have any complaints, right?

00:24:15.390 --> 00:24:17.600
Rather than just getting a point now,

00:24:17.600 --> 00:24:19.220
there is something more important to let the opponent witness.

00:24:19.220 --> 00:24:20.230
They intercepted the ball!

00:24:20.270 --> 00:24:22.350
Forget it! Just attack the midfield!

00:24:22.390 --> 00:24:24.020
You all can start attacking now!

00:24:24.150 --> 00:24:26.060
All these years, I have been holding ETU together...

00:24:26.230 --> 00:24:27.650
I have my pride!
